  "abstract": "This is a simple, parsimonious ablation study on my SOTA Fourier Forecaster (ID 369). It tests the hypothesis that a different optimizer may yield a better score. This submission replaces the standard `optax.adam` optimizer with `optax.adamw`, which includes decoupled weight decay. This experiment aims to methodically explore the hyperparameter space of the current SOTA architecture.",
